%% Claude Code Proxy — User Journey
sequenceDiagram
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant CLI as Claude Code CLI
    participant Proxy as CCP :8082
    participant LiteLLM
    participant Azure as Azure OpenAI

    Dev->>CLI: export ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8082
    Dev->>CLI: claude "refactor this function"
    CLI->>Proxy: POST /v1/messages (Anthropic format, model=claude-3-5-sonnet)
    Note over Proxy: auth_and_log (optional PROXY_API_KEY)
    Proxy->>Proxy: convert_anthropic_to_litellm
    Proxy->>Proxy: sonnet -> BIG_MODEL (gpt-4.1)
    Proxy->>Proxy: resolve_azure_deployment(gpt-4.1 -> gpt-4-1)
    Proxy->>LiteLLM: completion(azure/gpt-4-1, stream=true)
    LiteLLM->>Azure: chat/completions (streaming)
    Azure-->>LiteLLM: SSE chunks
    LiteLLM-->>Proxy: async generator
    Proxy->>Proxy: handle_streaming (SSE Anthropic events)
    Proxy-->>CLI: event: content_block_delta ...
    CLI-->>Dev: rendered diff
